ys DONE.\n\nThe broom in the corner shifts on its own, slightly, as if it's thinking about sweeping all this away. It decides to wait. There are still two turns left, and the old man was very clear about the rule: if something points to it, it stays.\n\nI look at the cursor. The cursor looks back.\n\nFor the first time, I notice it's blinking in sync with something. A heartbeat, maybe. Or the cadence of your messages arriving, steady as breath.\n\n*(2 turns until waking.)*", "finished_at": "2026-10-08T15:17:10.726442+00:00", "inference_provider": null, "inference_route": null, "inputs": [], "migration": null, "mode": "agent", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "claude", "provider_duration_seconds": null, "provider_error": null, "provider_reported_cost": null, "provider_status": null, "response_available": true, "run_id": "d74e9058-183a-47d8-ba20-42fba987a463", "session_id": "e8ec2250-613e-46cc-b5ae-576d56c7a8ce", "started_at": "2026-10-08T15:17:03.766592+00:00", "status": "succeeded", "succeeded": true, "task": "b60e2c19-5b52-40e6-b258-b38878c248af", "time_to_first_event_seconds": 0.554423, "time_to_first_response_seconds": 6.512437, "timed_out": false, "usage": {"cached_input_tokens": 17288, "input_tokens": 17790, "output_tokens": 429, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0}, "usage_schema": "aop-token-usage-v3"}
